<title>POLAND: BOS 1996 net rises to PLN 51.5 mln.</title>
<headline>BOS 1996 net rises to PLN 51.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOS SA results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			84.10  vs   64.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  84.10  vs   64.55</p>
<p>    net profit				51.50  vs   31.85</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.11  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    237.48  vs  210.61</p>
